{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_04",
  "title": "機械獣の咆哮",
  "storyCode": "RI-4",
  "avgTag": "戦闘前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "dfcfe1700602f934832597902cc8ef8b0be8386661ec0b7b836cee07d98ffbfc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アダクリス人A",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "ユーネクテス！　ユーネクテス！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アダクリス人B",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "全員やっつけろ、ユーネクテス！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アダクリス人C",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "大族長、大族長！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アダクリス人D",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "ユーネクテス、結婚してくれ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アダクリスの勇士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……ユーネクテスか、来たな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アダクリスの勇士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ジャングルに引きこもってもう出てこないのかと思ったぜ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ユーネクテス",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "ジャングルはいい場所だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アダクリスの勇士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ヘッ、ジャングルで縮こまってるティアカウは全員腰抜け野郎だ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ユーネクテス",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "腰抜けかどうか、試してみるといい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "ズゥママのヤツ、ヘンテコな装備は増えたけど、性格は昔のまんまだな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "おっと、ドクター、紹介がまだだったな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "舞台にいるあいつはズゥママってんだ。別部族の奴だったけど、縄張りが近くてさ。歳も近いし、要は幼馴染ってヤツだな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "あいつはあんまり喋らねぇけど、実力は本物さ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "でもいつの間にか変になっちまってたんだ。喧嘩をやめて、おかしなモンを弄るようになってさ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "それから気付いたら部族ごと引っ越しちまって、会う機会もほとんどなくなった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "聞いた話じゃ、喧嘩はまだ強いけど妙な病気に罹ったとかで、誰もいないところで独り言を言うようになったらしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "ロドスで似た症状を調べてみたんだが、精神疾患の類だと思う。だがこうやって見ると、割とまともに見えるな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "前回の祭典には出ると思ってたのに、結局来なかったんだ。あのときは本当に残念だったなぁ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "それにしても、今やユーネクテスなんて洒落た名前を名乗ってるとはな。あいつが来たんなら大族長はもう決まりだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アダクリスの勇士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ぐはっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "へぇ、やっぱりあいつも強くなってやがる。アタシもやり合ってみたいぜ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "トミミ",
      "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
      "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "……ズゥママは強い。でも……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "ん？　あそこにいるのは……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アダクリス人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ユーネクテス、次はオレたちがお前に挑むぜ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ユーネクテス",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "お前たちは？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アダクリス人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "オレはフレイム族の族長、ウダイ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アダクリス人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "オレはスカー族の族長、アルナ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウダイ＆アルナ",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "野郎ども、前に出ろ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ユーネクテス",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "まとめてかかってくるのか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウダイ",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "へへっ、オレたちはどう……なんだっけ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アルナ",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "アホ、同盟だ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウダイ",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あーそれだ、同盟を結んだんだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アルナ",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "簡単に大族長になれると思うなよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ユーネクテス",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "簡単になれるだなんて思ってない。それにしても、お前たちが仲が良かったなんて初耳だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウダイ",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "オレたちにも事情があんだよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アルナ",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "へっ、機械ばっか弄ってるようなヤツが大族長になるなんて、気に食わねぇんだよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "祭典って、複数で参加できるものなのか？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "トミミ",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "えっ？　はい、そうですよ。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "なんて顔してんだ、ドクター。もしかして祭典を決闘かなにかだと勘違いしてないか？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "一対一ではなかったのか？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "トミミ",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "えっ？　全部一対一だと時間がかかるじゃないですか。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "面子のために大抵は一対一でやるんだが、厳密にはルール無用だ。要は全員ぶちのめして、最後まで勝ち残ったヤツが大族長ってわけさ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "舎弟を連れてくのは、一番手っ取り早い方法だな。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "ルール無用？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "ドクター、まさか参加するつもりじゃないだろうな。やめといたほうがいいぜ。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "おいドクター、なに悪い顔してんだよ。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "それなら自分も大族長になれそう。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "ハハハ、残念だがドクターじゃ無理だ。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "ルール無用って言っても、ドクターが考えてるような手段は誰も使わねぇよ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "ここの奴らは単純だからな。何でもありだとしても、思いつくのはせいぜい人手を増やすことくらいだ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "回りくどい小細工をするヤツなんて、いやしないのさ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "正直、ロドスで何年も暮らしてるアタシですら、そういうのは未だに慣れねぇしな。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "でも、人数が多ければいいってわけじゃないんですよ。多対一にもリスクはあります。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "ハハ、そうだな。あとで仲間割れするのも珍しくないからな。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "それに、もしドクターが考えてるような方法を使ったら――"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "間違いなくリンチだ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "人聞きの悪いことを言うな。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "ハハハ、ホントのことを言っただけだ。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "ハハ、ドクターがそんな顔をするなんて珍しいな。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "みんな純粋なんだなぁ。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "そうだな。純粋でいいとこだろ？　アタシも外に出るまではわかんなかった。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "昔はどこのヤツも同じだって思ってたからな。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "まぁ本当のところ、ドクターが本気になればバレずに小細工で勝つこともできると思う。だけど、お前とあいつらの間には決定的な差がある。何かわかるか？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "筋肉？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "そうだ！　お前、見るからに弱そうだもんな！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "おいドクター、そう拗ねるな、話を聞けって！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "まぁそれも正解だ。ドクターはここのヤツらと比べたら、風に吹き飛ばされそうなくらい貧弱だもんな。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "外見？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "とにかくだ、大族長になるための条件は至極単純さ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "腕っぷしが強くて、ゲンコツが痛くて、喧嘩じゃ誰にも負けねぇってことだ！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "だろ、トミミ？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "えっ、は、はい！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "しかし妙だな、あの二人は友達でも何でもなかったはずだろ。まさか手を組むなんてな……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "うーん、ガヴィルさんが出て行った後、仲良しになったんじゃないですか？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "まぁそうかもな。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "つーかズゥママは族長なんだよな？　子分たちはどうしたんだ？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "確かにそう言われれば、あまりズゥママの部族の人は見てません……えーっと……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "あ、いました！　あそこの変わった恰好をしている人たちがそうですよ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "へえ、いい装備を持ってんじゃねぇか。でも人数は確かに少ねぇ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "もしかしてあいつ、まさかアタシみたいに一人で全員ぶちのめすつもりか？　おもしれぇ！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "っていうか、お前も参加すんだろ、トミミ？　こんなとこで見てていいのかよ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "えっ、はい！　まだ大丈夫です。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "ズゥママの強さにはスカー族は足元にも及びませんが、体力は消耗させてくれるはずです。私は彼女が疲れたところで出ていく予定なんです。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "ほほう、賢くなったな、トミミ。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "トミミ",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "えへへ、私だって本気で大族長になりたいですから！　そしたら……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "そしたら？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ガヴィル",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "おっと、話は後だ、始まったぞ！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
